{
  "note": "Derived by hand from the BDS vanilla behavior pack (behavior_packs/vanilla/loot_tables/entities/*.json), in the same shape. Only constructs Zenith honours are present; the loader rejects anything else. Left out on purpose because the system behind them does not exist yet: looting_enchant (no enchantments), furnace_smelt on a burning cow (no fire), killed_by_entity (creeper records need the killer's type), random_chance_with_looting (written as plain random_chance). Villager and bat award nothing, as in the pack; the minecart awards itself.",
